[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ！\u3000レスナちゃんおかえり！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Welcome back, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロロナ先輩、トトリ先輩！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miss Rorona, Miss Totori!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "参考になるか分からないけど、わたしの師匠から教えて\nもらったホムンクルスの創り方、まとめておいたから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't know if it'll help, but I wrote down everything my master taught me about creating homunculi!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "他にも、トトリちゃんと一緒に使えそうな本とか\n探してみたんだ。よかったら読んでみて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori and I also found some books that might be useful. Give them a look if you'd like!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ……ありがとうございます！\n感謝感激雨あられです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Th-thank you so much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "失礼する",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pardon the intrusion."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キースグリフ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Keithgriff"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆さん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "王宮の書庫から使えそうな資料を借りてきました。\nそれから、オートマタに関する情報も",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We borrowed some promising documents from the royal library. And some information about automata too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アーシャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "オディーリアの記憶回路から、オレたちのいた世界に\nあった書物の情報を復元した",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We reconstructed information from books in our world using Odelia's memory circuits."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キースグリフ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Keithgriff"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "復元と言っても、読み上げてもらったものを\n手で写しただけですけどね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though by 'reconstructed,' I mean we just wrote down what she recited..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アーシャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こ、この量を手で！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-you wrote all this by hand!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナー！\u3000調子はどう？\nまた使えそうな素材とか集めてきたよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna! How's it going? I gathered some materials that might come in handy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ライザ先輩も！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miss Ryza too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆さん……本当にありがとうございます！\n私、頑張ります！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone... thank you so much! I'll do my best!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃん、戻ってきてから\nずーっと本とにらめっこしてるね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna's been staring at those books ever since she got back."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、大丈夫なの？\u3000ぜんぜん休憩してないし……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You okay, Resna? You haven't taken a single break..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。ですが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. However..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "表情から迷いが消えましたわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The uncertainty has vanished from her expression."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナには見えてきたのかもしれません。\n奇跡を生み出すための筋道が",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perhaps Resna has begun to see it—the path to creating a miracle."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……邪魔にならぬよう、\nわたくしたちは退散するとしましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Let us take our leave, so as not to disturb her."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ロロナ先輩が創ったホムンクルス。オディーリアさん\n\u3000のようなオートマタ。あるいは人造頂獣……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The homunculus Miss Rorona created. Automata like Odelia. Or even man-made Apexi...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ヴァレリアはそのどれとも違う。でも、錬金術に\n\u3000よって生み出された生命であることは同じ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Valeria is different from all of them. But she was still created through alchemy.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（おかげで、方向性は固まってきた。あとは――）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Thanks to everyone, I'm starting to see the way forward. Now—)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（想像する。目覚めるヴァレリアの姿を）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I need to imagine it. Picture Valeria when she wakes up.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（すごく強くて、かっこよくて、\n\u3000でもちょっと食いしんぼなところがあって……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(So strong and cool, but with that adorable appetite of hers...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ときどき無茶なこともするけど、\n\u3000家族思いで、友達思いで……いつも助けてくれる）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Sometimes reckless, but always caring about family and friends... always there to help...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（素直に、思ったままのヴァレリアの姿を、思い描く）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Just picture Valeria exactly as she is, straight from the heart.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……っ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（想像する。目覚めるヴァレリアの姿を……！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I need to imagine it. Picture Valeria when she wakes up...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いける、これなら……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This could work, I might be onto something...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この部位に使われているの、どの図鑑にも載って\nいなかったあの素材だ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This component uses that material I couldn't find in any of the encyclopedias..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（核の破片に含まれていた未知の素材……\n\u3000回収した分だけじゃぜんぜん足りない）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The unknown material in the core fragments... We definitely don't have enough of what we recovered.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（成分の解析はできてるから、別の素材で代替\n\u3000できないか検証してみるしかないかな……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I've analyzed its properties, so maybe I can try finding substitute materials...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（でも……これ、\n\u3000どこかで見たことある気がするんだけど……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But... I feel like I've seen this somewhere before...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]